<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the auction of a second tranche of July 15, 1998 18-month Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) of which 2.5 trillion lire worth was offered.</p>
<p>			   Jan 15, 1999     previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.86 pct	 5.19</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.59 pct	 5.92</p>
<p>Assigned price	  91.15	    91.75</p>
<p>Bids			1.679 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  1.679 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction of a first tranche of the new July 15, 1998 CTZs on January 10.</p>
</text>
